s have a color overlay that corresponds to the output of the <code class=3D=
"literal">gradCAM</code> function. The regions of the image that most influ=
enced the network classification appear with bright colors on the overlay. =
For the image classified as an <code class=3D"literal">Edge-Ring</code> def=
ect, the defects at the boundary at the die were treated as important. A po=
ssible reason for this could be there are far more <code class=3D"literal">=
Edge-Ring</code> images in the training set as compared to <code class=3D"l=
iteral">Donut</code> images.</p><p><span class=3D"guiicon"><span class=3D"i=
